    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. they want to prolong the ending. but if the story is already over, why does it feel so wrong to just... let it be over? like, if you finish a beautiful book, you don't keep reading empty pages forever. you just close it. i feel like i'm just staring at empty pages and everyone is mad that i'm not trying to write more.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
