      "content": "I understand the profound distress of feeling abandoned with only \"empty pages\" when the \"story\" of you feels like it ended so long ago. hurting after the \"end\" of a chapter is not a failure to try; it is the natural, painful weight of what was real. Please consider speaking to a self-help group for grief or a support line that understands the finality you feel, as they can help you feel less alone in this \"theater.\"\n\nI hope you can find a safe space to just \"close the book\" without judgment.",
